; fs-remount: after a reboot (stop QEMU with a tool that syncs the guest first),
; mount SBA: and SBB: again and hash what fs and fs-par wrote: everything
; must have survived on the disk.
;   Execute SHARED:sbench/fs-remount
FailAt 30
Mount SBA: FROM SHARED:sbench/sb.mountlist
Mount SBB: FROM SHARED:sbench/sb.mountlist
CD SBA:
C:MD5Sum C/#? Libs/#? >SHARED:sbench/out/fs-ffs-remount.md5
CD SBA:par
C:MD5Sum #? >SHARED:sbench/out/fs-parA-remount.md5
CD SBB:
C:MD5Sum C/#? Libs/#? >SHARED:sbench/out/fs-sfs-remount.md5
CD SBB:par
C:MD5Sum #? >SHARED:sbench/out/fs-parB-remount.md5
CD RAM:
Echo "fs-remount done" >SHARED:sbench/out/fs-remount.done
